<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 76 FOR NO LOSS AT LUNCH ON FIRST DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 76 FOR NO LOSS AT LUNCH ON FIRST DAY.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 76 for no loss at lunch on the opening day after choosing to bat first in the third and final test against South Africa at Kanpur's Green Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>At lunch, openers Nayan Mongia on 41 and Woorkeri Raman on 34 were at the crease.</p>
